ter-music (2.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * 10-band ISO graphic equalizer with biquad IIR DSP.
  * Visual bar chart EQ UI in settings panel.
  * Config schema v2.2 with equalizer persistence.
  * PipeWire audio backend improvements.

